{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_research_component_library_md", "label": "The component library's provenance (ledger, docs/research/component-library.md)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/research/component-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_research_component_library_provenance_requirement", "label": "Provenance requirement for part parameters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/research/component-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every shipped value is an M1 estimate recorded in the open; the loader refuses a part file whose data skips a [provenance] entry. The follow-up is datasheet transcription (OpenMotor motor, OpenVTX VTXs), which lands by editing only the part file."}, {"id": "docs_research_component_library_pole_pairs_ruling", "label": "motor.pole_pairs = 7 ruling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/research/component-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The OpenMotor 2207 is a 14-pole motor, and 2 x 7 is Betaflight's motor_poles default of 14, so a quad whose diff leaves motor_poles unset agrees by construction; a diff that sets it is checked at load."}, {"id": "docs_research_component_library_prop_imbalance_ruling", "label": "prop.imbalance_kgm = 0.0 ruling", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/research/component-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There is no measurement, and the parameter is the M4b vibration model's input, so it stays 0 until that model lands."}, {"id": "library_frames_opendrone_5f_toml", "label": "library/frames/opendrone-5f.toml (OpenDrone 5F frame part)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/research/component-librar